# CloudShare — Environment Configuration Template
# The application backend configuration is in: backend/.env
#
# Key Backend Settings:
# - AWS_REGION: AWS Region (e.g., ap-south-1)
# - AWS_S3_BUCKET: Name of your private Amazon S3 bucket
# - AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID: Your AWS IAM Access Key ID
# - AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY: Your AWS IAM Secret Access Key
# - AWS_SESSION_TOKEN: (Optional) Session token for AWS Academy / Learner Lab
# - JWT_SECRET: Secret key for signing user authentication tokens
# - DATABASE_PATH: SQLite database filename
